sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Reader as 👤 Bạn đọc
    participant Ctrl as ReservationController<br/>(/api/v1/reservations)
    participant Svc as ReservationAppService
    participant BookRepo as IBookTitleRepository
    participant MemRepo as IMemberRepository
    participant ResRepo as IReservationRepository
    participant UoW as IUnitOfWork & EventBus

    Reader->>Ctrl: POST /api/v1/reservations {bookTitleId} + Bearer JWT
    activate Ctrl
    Ctrl->>Svc: createReservation(ReserveCommand)
    activate Svc

    Svc->>BookRepo: findById(bookTitleId)
    BookRepo-->>Svc: bookTitle: BookTitle

    alt bookTitle.availableCopies > 0
        Svc-->>Ctrl: throw BookCurrentlyAvailableException (409)
        Ctrl-->>Reader: HTTP 409 Conflict ("Sách đang sẵn có trên kệ, mời mượn trực tiếp")
    else Tất cả bản sao đều đang bận (availableCopies == 0)
        Svc->>MemRepo: findByUserId(currentUserId)
        MemRepo-->>Svc: member: Member
        Svc->>ResRepo: countActiveByMember(member.id)
        ResRepo-->>Svc: activeCount (kiểm tra < 3 phiếu chờ & chưa đặt trùng)

        Svc->>ResRepo: getNextQueuePosition(bookTitleId)
        ResRepo-->>Svc: nextPos (FIFO)
        Svc->>Svc: Reservation.create(member.id, bookTitleId, nextPos)
        Svc->>ResRepo: save(reservation)
        Svc->>UoW: commitTransaction() & publish(ReservationCreatedEvent)
        UoW-->>Svc: Committed OK

        Svc-->>Ctrl: ReservationDto (reservationCode, queuePosition, status=PENDING)
        Ctrl-->>Reader: HTTP 201 Created + JSON ReservationDto
    end
    deactivate Svc
    deactivate Ctrl
